              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "DiamondGirl amanecer"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is a very refreshing cocktail for a hot weather. Following the recipe, I realized it needs a little sugar for me. I added 1/2 teaspoon brown sugar and it was perfect. I tried to add a little coconut milk for the next portion and liked it too. The cocktail is close to refreshing iced drinks with fruit flavor that serve some bars at the beach."
          },
