              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "ConkyJoe"
            },
            "reviewBody": "A very basic, refreshing smoothie with a convoluted name. Made this with optional coconut. Without either of the optional ingredients, this smoothie would be rather ho-hum. I think the three reviews preceding mine over a 3 year period is a function of the odd name given to this recipe since it does not pull up in a ingredient search of ‘smoothies’ or under AR’s ‘Banana Smoothies’ collection. That’s a shame because you can make a tasty smoothie, clean-up the blender, and be out the door with it in less than 5 minutes.",
